---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout lang="ko" title="404 — 페이지를 찾을 수 없음 | JSON Compare Online" description="요청한 페이지를 찾을 수 없습니다. 무료 온라인 JSON 비교, 서식 지정, 검증 및 변환 도구를 살펴보세요." canonicalPath="/404">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-20 text-center">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-red-100 dark:bg-red-950/40 text-[11px] font-mono text-red-700 dark:text-red-400 mb-6 border border-red-200 dark:border-red-900/60"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-500 animate-pulse"></span>HTTP 404 • 리소스를 찾을 수 없음</div>
    <h1 class="text-6xl sm:text-7xl font-black tracking-tight text-[#111111] dark:text-[#f0f0f2] font-mono mb-4">404</h1>
    <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-[#111111] dark:text-[#f0f0f2] mb-3">구문 트리에서 잃어버린 페이지</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-[#4b4b4d] dark:text-[#9ca3af] max-w-md mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-8">요청한 문서나 경로가 없거나 재구성되었을 수 있습니다. 아래 링크를 사용하여 핵심 개발자 도구로 돌아가세요.</p>
    <div class="mb-10"><div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-3 text-xs font-semibold"><a href="/ko/" class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#f5f5f5] dark:bg-[#14161b] border border-[#e5e5e5] dark:border-[#22242a] hover:border-[#111111] dark:hover:border-[#f0f0f2] text-[#111111] dark:text-[#f0f0f2] transition-colors">JSON 비교</a><a href="/ko/tools/json-formatter" class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#f5f5f5] dark:bg-[#14161b] border border-[#e5e5e5] dark:border-[#22242a] hover:border-[#111111] dark:hover:border-[#f0f0f2] text-[#111111] dark:text-[#f0f0f2] transition-colors">JSON 포맷터</a><a href="/ko/tools/json-validator" class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#f5f5f5] dark:bg-[#14161b] border border-[#e5e5e5] dark:border-[#22242a] hover:border-[#111111] dark:hover:border-[#f0f0f2] text-[#111111] dark:text-[#f0f0f2] transition-colors">JSON 검증기</a><a href="/ko/tools/json-to-typescript" class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#f5f5f5] dark:bg-[#14161b] border border-[#e5e5e5] dark:border-[#22242a] hover:border-[#111111] dark:hover:border-[#f0f0f2] text-[#111111] dark:text-[#f0f0f2] transition-colors">JSON → TS</a></div></div>
    <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-4"><a href="/ko/" class="px-6 py-2.5 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-[#111111] text-white hover:bg-[#39393b] dark:bg-[#f0f0f2] dark:text-[#111111] dark:hover:bg-white transition-colors">홈으로 돌아가기</a><a href="/ko/contact" class="px-6 py-2.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-[#f5f5f5] dark:bg-[#18191d] text-[#111111] dark:text-[#f0f0f2] border border-[#cacacb] dark:border-[#2b2d35] hover:bg-[#e5e5e5] dark:hover:bg-[#252830] transition-colors">깨진 링크 신고</a></div>
  </div>
</Layout>
